cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Finite Precision Loop Mechanics"
abstract: >
  A mechanism-first exploration of finite-precision physics.
  Physical evolution cannot carry infinite precision; rounding becomes a
  physical mechanism that creates thresholds, attractor basins (loop traps),
  inertia-like resistance, and residue-like leakage.
  The repository includes theoretical documentation, reproducible Python
  scripts, and numerical evidence from Gaussian-integer models Z[i]/(p).
authors:
